---
import Base from "../layouts/Base.astro";
import Button from "../components/Button.astro";
---
<Base
  title="Download — WhisperFlow"
  description="Download WhisperFlow for Windows, or build from source. Free, open-source, Apache-2.0."
>
  <section class="hero-backdrop border-b border-line/70">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-4 py-20 sm:px-6">
      <h1 class="text-4xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-5xl">Download</h1>
      <p class="mt-4 max-w-2xl text-lg text-ink-dim">
        WhisperFlow is in active development toward v0.1. Until the first tagged release,
        run it from source — it takes about two minutes.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="border-b border-line/70">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-4 py-16 sm:px-6">
      <div class="grid gap-5 md:grid-cols-2">
        <div class="rounded-2xl border border-line bg-surface/60 p-8">
          <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
            <span class="text-2xl">🪟</span>
            <h2 class="text-xl font-bold">Windows</h2>
          </div>
          <p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-6 text-ink-dim">
            Windows 10/11 (x64). The installer with auto-updates ships with the first stable
            release — grab the GitHub release when it lands, or build from source now.
          </p>
          <div class="mt-6 flex flex-wrap gap-3">
            <Button href="https://github.com/namandhakad712/whisperflow/releases">Releases (soon)</Button>
            <Button href="/docs/getting-started/" variant="ghost">Build from source</Button>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="rounded-2xl border border-line bg-surface/60 p-8">
          <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
            <span class="text-2xl">🍎</span>
            <h2 class="text-xl font-bold">macOS &amp; Linux</h2>
          </div>
          <p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-6 text-ink-dim">
            The engine and UI are cross-platform; packaging for macOS and Linux is on the v0.2
            roadmap. Contributions welcome — global shortcuts and paste injection are the only
            platform-specific pieces.
          </p>
          <div class="mt-6">
            <Button href="https://github.com/namandhakad712/whisperflow" variant="ghost">Track progress on GitHub</Button>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="mt-10 rounded-2xl border border-line bg-surface/60 p-8">
        <h2 class="text-lg font-bold">First launch checklist</h2>
        <ol class="mt-4 list-decimal space-y-2 pl-5 text-sm leading-6 text-ink-dim">
          <li>Allow microphone access when Windows asks.</li>
          <li>Pick a model in the built-in manager — it downloads straight from HuggingFace (whisper.cpp binaries included, no compiler needed).</li>
          <li>Test your hotkey in the onboarding wizard, then dictate anywhere.</li>
        </ol>
        <p class="mt-4 text-xs text-ink-dim">
          Everything is Apache-2.0. No account, no telemetry, no word caps.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>
